# Label provenance

For a simulated metagenome, the evaluation id is the `tax_id` on the `sim` row of the accession table. That value is fixed before reads are generated.

Do not score Kraken, Kaiju, CheckM, k-means colours, mock labels, or any other prediction as that id. A contig may receive the sim taxid only when it is tied to that simulated accession.

Do not put that taxid into the graph the GCN trains on. Forbidden carriers:

- node or edge features
- edge weights
- node or edge colours, including a taxon palette copied from the CDBG

The id may be stored only as the evaluation vector used after training. A training loss that takes the evaluation taxid, or a call that emits it, is the same leak.
